{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2021b.q31.material.recovered", "text": "在美术鉴赏模块中，张老师要求学生分小组收集、欣赏、评述自己喜欢的美术作品，并结合学生质量水平标准，提出了评价要求：“能否主动探究，能否团结协作，能否形成自己独特的观点。”教学结束时，张老师凭借自己的印象给每个学生评价为“良”以上。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c1189f7eadce26edd7886331bc3b16381e9a69843b36598f9d0491236b28ac09", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1762, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1877, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "c1189f7eadce26edd7886331bc3b16381e9a69843b36598f9d0491236b28ac09"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2021b.q31"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k08", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k09"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.414.r003", "ntce.outline.414.r004", "ntce.outline.414.r005", "ntce.outline.414.r009", "ntce.outline.414.r013", "ntce.outline.414.r020", "ntce.outline.414.r032"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2021b.q31"], "word_count": 115, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c1189f7eadce26edd7886331bc3b16381e9a69843b36598f9d0491236b28ac09", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1762, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1877, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "loc